接受不同媒體訪問。\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E💡在美國預計減息，新樓潛在供應在高位徘徊，減辣效應不彰等因素影響下，香港樓價何去何從？上車、換樓或投資，何時是良機？\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003E日期：2024年2月5日(星期一)\u003Cbr\u003E時間：晚上7:30-8:45\u003Cbr\u003E地點：旺角登打士街56號家樂坊安利體驗館會議室，Zoom同步直播\u003Cbr\u003E費用：$40\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cspan style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;;\"\u003E報名：請傳電郵到aksempowerhk@gmail.com 或在 Facebook.com\u002Fempower.hk 給我們Messanger 訊息。謝謝！\u003C\u002Fspan\u003E\u003C\u002Fp\u003E\u003Cp\u003EPowered by Empower\u003Cbr\u003Ewww.Empower.hk\u003Cbr\u003EFacebook.com\u002FEmpower.hk\u003Cbr\u003EYouTube.com\u002FEmpowerhk\u003C\u002Fp\u003E","團結香港基金副總裁 葉文祺先生","Ryan_240205","2023-12-17T02:41:05.210Z",{"data":297},[298],{"id":15,"attributes":299},{"name":17,"slug":18,"description":10,"createdAt":19,"updatedAt":20},{"data":301},{"id":302,"attributes":303},36,{"name":304,"alternativeText":10,"caption":10,"width":26,"height":27,"formats":305,"hash":326,"ext":30,"mime":33,"size":327,"url":328,"previewUrl":10,"provider":61,"provider_metadata":10,"createdAt":329,"updatedAt":329},"Screenshot 2023-12-15 at 4.30.54 PM.png",{"large":306,"small":311,"medium":316,"thumbnail":321},{"ext":30,"url":307,"hash":308,"mime":33,"name":309,"path":10,"size":310,"width":36,"height":37},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Flarge_Screenshot_2023_12_15_at_4_30_54_PM_8f46c14de4.png","large_Screenshot_2023_12_15_at_4_30_54_PM_8f46c14de4","large_Screenshot 2023-12-15 at 4.30.54 PM.png",593.91,{"ext":30,"url":312,"hash":313,"mime":33,"name":314,"path":10,"size":315,"width":43,"height":44},"https:\u002F\u002Fempowerhk.s3.ap-southeast-1.amazonaws.com\u002Fsmall_Screenshot_2023_12_15_at_4_30_54_PM_8f46c14de4.png","small_Screenshot_2023_1